informal_statement:
For any set \( s \) of extended non-negative real numbers, the preimage of the preimage of \( s \) under the functions \( \text{toReal} \) and \( \text{ofReal} \) is equal to:
- \( s \) itself, if both infinity and zero are elements of \( s \);
- \( s \) union \( \{ \infty \} \), if zero is an element of \( s \) but infinity is not;
- \( s \) minus \( \{ \infty \} \), if neither zero nor infinity is an element of \( s \).
